quran[10]{c,v,t}:
  11,118,"And had your Lord pleased, He would have made all humankind one community. But they continue to have their differences,"
  11,119,"except those upon whom your Lord shows mercy, for He has created them to be this way. And the Word of your Lord is fulfilled: ‘I shall surely fill Hell with (the unjust and corrupt) jinn and men all together.’"
  11,120,"And (O Prophet!) whatever We relate to you from the stories of the messengers is that by which We strengthen your heart. There has come to you in this (revelation) the truth, an advice and a reminder to the believers."
  11,121,And say to those who do not believe: ‘Act according to your position; we are also acting (according to ours).
  11,122,And wait! Surely we (too) are waiting.’
  11,123,"To Allah belongs (the knowledge of) the Unseen of the heavens and the earth. And to Him, all matters are returned. So worship Him and trust in Him. And your Lord is not heedless of what you do."
  12,1,"Alif, Lam, Ra. These are the Verses of the Manifest Book."
  12,2,We have revealed it as an Arabic Qur’an so that you may understand (it easily).
  12,3,"We recount to you the most beautiful stories through what We have revealed to you in (the form of) this Qur’an. And before it, you were among those who were unaware (of this information)."
  12,4,"And (recall) when Yusuf (Joseph) said to his father: ‘O my father! I have seen eleven stars, the sun and the moon. I saw them prostrating before me.’"
